Creator… Pete Rock &amp; CL Smooth</li><li>Mistakes Of A Woman In Love With Other Men… Slick Rick</li><li>KRS-One drop</li><li>Lost at Birth… Public Enemy</li><li>Ooh The Dew Doo Man… Resident Alien</li><li>Smooth B drop</li><li>Hip-Hop Junkies… Nice &amp; Smooth</li><li>Guard Your Grill… Naughty By Nature</li><li>Just the Two of Us… Chubb Rock</li><li>Check the Rhime… A Tribe Called Quest (cut)</li><li>Airbreak/Ads/Airbreak</li><li>Don’t Curse (feat. Kool G Rap, Grand Puba, CL Smooth, Big Daddy Kane, Pete Rock, and Q-Tip)… Heavy D</li><li>Just Serving Justice… Poor Righteous Teachers</li><li>The Symphony, Pt. II (feat. Masta Ace, Craig G, Big Daddy Kane, Lil’ Daddy Shane, and Kool G Rap)… Marley Marl (partial)</li></ul>","language":"eng","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":["wprb","hip-hop","radio","princeton"],"title":"Raw Deal: October 17, 1991","publicdate":"2016-06-01 21:39:31","uploader":"rmacmich@gmail.com","addeddate":"2016-06-01 21:39:31","curation":"[curator]validator@archive.org[/curator][date]20160601214012[/date][comment]checked for malware[/comment]","backup_location":"ia906109_25","year":"1991","hhra_title":"Raw Deal","hhra_callletters":"WPRB","hhra_stationfreq":"103.3 FM","hhra_location":"Princeton, NJ, USA","hhra_college":"Princeton University","hhra_credit":"Laze","hhra_sourceurl":"http://www.rawdealradio.com/shows/october-17-1991/","hhra_djshosts":"Eazy M, G"},"server":"ia600309.us.archive.org","uniq":177536936,"workable_servers":["ia600309.us.archive.org","ia800309.us.archive.org"]}